  "bodyHash": "3smaTTSJLs0=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a63a5df88e4fc0a95cdd3e5f836d90c488ed61ff_0.webp\" alt=\"Mizuno 優質樹葉\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">一個為可食用與可飲用物品添加精靈動畫的材質包。</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170466/description_399a4e15-f79c-4e1f-8c23-53a97fcf7438.gif\" alt=\"測試\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>1.21.3 或以下版本需安裝 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eating-animation-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">進食動畫模組</a><br></strong><strong>（自 1.21.4+ 起無需安裝模組）</strong></p><p><strong>支援農夫樂事 1.21.4+</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>我所有的 Mizuno 附加元件：<br></strong></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-better-leaves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno 優質樹葉</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unofficial-mizunos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">非官方 Mizuno 系列</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-connected-texture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 連接紋理</a><br></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-x-fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno × 鮮活動畫</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-dark-mode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 深色模式</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-connected-glass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 連接玻璃</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-eating-animation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 進食動畫</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-better-grass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 優質草地</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-copper-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 銅製工具</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-allay-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 悅靈變種</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-chicken-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno 雞隻變種</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-chicken-variants-x-fa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno 雞隻變種 × FA</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-fox-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 狐狸變種</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-cow-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 牛隻變種</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-cow-variants-x-fa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 牛隻變種 × FA</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-pig-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 豬隻變種</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-pig-variants-x-fa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno 豬隻變種 × FA</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno × 農夫樂事</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-storage-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno × 儲物樂事</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-crate-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno × 板條箱樂事</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-frights-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno × 驚悚樂事</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-display-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno × 展示樂事</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-rustic-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno × 鄉村樂事</a></strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-ubes-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno × 芋頭樂事</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-vegan-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno × 素食樂事</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-handcrafted\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno × 手工藝品</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-letsdo-farm-and-charm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno × 動手做農場與魅力</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-letsdo-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno × 動手做家具</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-letsdo-bakery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno × 動手做烘焙坊</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-reinforced-chest-barrels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno × 強化箱與桶</strong></a></li>\n</ul><p><strong>其他專案：</strong></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fShorkBee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/130037dd8c972d8573f49d7928b542711e2f6ed4.png\" alt=\"連結至 ShorkBee\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shorkbee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c450b18c2c965d2e2a798f1576231a1f1f37458e_0.webp\" alt=\"連結至 ShorkBee\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
